# graphify exclusions for dpd-db.
# The repo's data corpora dwarf the code: one dictionary JSON can hold
# ~500k entries, and the extractor makes a node per entry. Without this
# file the graph passed 1.5M nodes / 1.2 GB — past graphify's 512 MiB
# query cap, so no command could read it. Keep this file to real code.
# Data corpora (third-party dictionaries, suttas, submodules)
resources/
# Legacy and generated dumps
archive/
exporter/archive/
exporter/share/
exporter/kindle/
exporter/kobo/
exporter/analysis/
exporter/tpr/output/
go_modules/deconstructor/output/
# Generated and runtime data
shared_data/
temp/
audio/
db/backup_tsv/
db/bold_definitions/
# Old thread plans (current kamma/threads stays indexed)
kamma/archive/
